  "description": "Our latest addition to the LEADER family is the VOLARE frameset. Made from triple-butted 4130 chromoly steel and inspired by our original Kagero pursuit track bike geometry, it all comes down to an incredible ride that is fast and smooth. VOLARE is available in 3 different colors and includes a sealed headset and fork within the module. We have taken extensive care in the production of the VOLARE. Both the chromoly frame and fork have gone through an electrophoresis anti-rust treatment as well as a chemical bath in ensuring you a frame that will last for years to come. VOLARE frame set comes with frame, fork, seat clamp (for 27.2mm dia. seat post) and head set (for 28.6mm dia. fork steerer). Build up the Volare with one of our Component Packs or with your favorite set of parts!",
